<Item XName="InEqns" UserName="InEqns" Type="Equation">
<AutoCalc><T>Bool</T><D>1</D></AutoCalc>
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>NumElements = 8;&#x000D;&#x000A;SpeedOfLight = 3e8;&#x000D;&#x000A;FRxTx = 10; % GHz&#x000D;&#x000A;WaveLength = SpeedOfLight / FRxTx / 1e9;&#x000D;&#x000A;clear SpeedOfLight;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;Theta = tune(0);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;[ThetaGrid, PhiGrid] = meshgrid([0:10:180]*pi/180,[0:10:360]*pi/180);&#x000D;&#x000A;SkyTemp = 290*ones(37,19); %290K&#x000D;&#x000A;SkyTemp(19,9) = 360; %360K&#x000D;&#x000A;</Text>
